When producing or reviewing a Lovable brief:

- Target product repo `tanviiiiir-r/rising-star-board` and Lovable project id `6e05f72b-e75f-4175-a163-ef7e3b9791d9` (DECISION-002 / 003).
- Brief MUST include: objectives, context, requirements, constraints, acceptance criteria, security, testing.
- Do not ask Lovable to redefine the business or to set prices/bids/credits/rewards.
- No fabricated rankings, users, or activity.
- Publish remains held (DECISION-014).
- If Lovable MCP is connected: one focused `send_message`; use `plan_mode` when risky; verify with `get_diff`. A chat claim is not evidence.
- If Lovable MCP is not connected: stop and ask the founder to authenticate. Do not invent preview URLs.
- Never force-push Lovable-synced git history.
